    description: "Filed during fundamental concept audit 2026-05-27 (pass identity/dependency model).\n\nrequires_symbols on RegisteredAnalyzer was designed for future multi-pass scheduling (\"this analyzer needs symbols from another analyzer\"). It is:\n- Declared on RegisteredAnalyzer (analyze/registry.py:99)\n- Accepted as a decorator kwarg (analyze/registry.py:148)\n- Never passed by any of the ~45 registered analyzers\n- Never consumed by any runtime code (all_analyzers.py doesn't read it)\n- Superseded by depends_on (INV-hujog), which uses a richer CNF model and is actually validated\n\n17 total references, all in registry.py definition/signature.\n\nFix: remove the field from RegisteredAnalyzer, remove the kwarg from register_analyzer, remove the comment referencing it. One-commit change."  # d017
    fields: {}  # d017
