  message: "Fixed in PR #3951. Removed requires_symbols field from RegisteredAnalyzer and the kwarg from @register_analyzer decorator. The field was never passed by any of ~45 analyzers and never consumed by any runtime code — superseded by depends_on (INV-hujog), which carries CNF pass-id dependencies that are actually validated. Added drift-guard test (test_no_requires_symbols_field) to lock down the removal."  # 80e0
